80/extras/888d0a77c9cdc8b4abaa51571038e7c2.webm?t=1768086447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876280/extras/888d0a77c9cdc8b4abaa51571038e7c2.mp4?t=1768086447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>And very silly aswell :3 <br>He has a joke for all the voice commands he has! <br> <br> <br><u><i><strong>He is very fast!</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876280/extras/dc6184d09b0db0c562561a6ddb82999d.poster.avif?t=1768086447\" width=550 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876280/extras/dc6184d09b0db0c562561a6ddb82999d.webm?t=1768086447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876280/extras/dc6184d09b0db0c562561a6ddb82999d.mp4?t=1768086447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is very fast on any computer from 2012 and up!<br>Only uses 3% of ur CPU and only 1.25% of ur RAM!!<br>Source: trust me bro &gt;w&lt;<br><br><br><u><i><strong>PAIcom can be FULLY MODDED (no coding knowledge required)</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876280/extras/54959f224f21a7b55b704e4a1cf5eab8.poster.avif?t=1768086447\" width=550 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876280/extras/54959f224f21a7b55b704e4a1cf5eab8.webm?t=1768086447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876280/extras/54959f224f21a7b55b704e4a1cf5eab8.mp4?t=1768086447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=